    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">Your favorite team has just finished its season. You are given the result of every match, in order: W for a win and L for a loss. A winning streak is a group of consecutive wins. Find the length of the longest winning streak, and how many separate times a streak of exactly that length happened.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\">Line 1: an integer N, the number of matches.<br>Line 2: a string of N characters, each one W or L.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\">One line with two integers separated by a space: the length of the longest winning streak, then the number of streaks of that length. If the team never won, print 0 0.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">1 &lt;= N &lt;= 100</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">10\nWWLWWWLLWW</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">3 1</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
